# Explicit module: adding a qmldir REPLACES the implicit directory listing,
# so every component must be named here, including for sibling references.
# It exists because Quickshell only auto-registers singletons found in the
# config ROOT, not in a subdirectory.

singleton Wallpaper Wallpaper.qml

WallpaperView        WallpaperView.qml
WallpaperPicker      WallpaperPicker.qml
